    "The CTO writes: 'Query Store shows nothing regressed, so it isn't a query problem.' The client ran its 'Top queries by",
    "CPU' and 'Regressed queries' reports on 28 Sep for the last 30 days. The ProductSearch endpoint, added on 30 Aug,",
    "builds its statement by concatenating the search term into the text. Name the reason why the reports show no",
    "problem."
